174
00:05:31,572 --> 00:05:33,242
Austin Green, Joseph Conway.

175
00:05:33,242 --> 00:05:34,743
"A medical student must confront

176
00:05:34,743 --> 00:05:37,066
"a corpse as a fraternity initiation prank

177
00:05:37,066 --> 00:05:39,320
"in this low-budget moo-zer."

178
00:05:39,320 --> 00:05:40,349
Huh.
- [Crow] Hm.

179
00:05:40,349 --> 00:05:41,550
- [Crow] Well, can we go then?

180
00:05:41,550 --> 00:05:42,929
- [Tom] I think this is the beginning

181
00:05:42,929 --> 00:05:45,759
of a long, hard ride here.

182
00:05:45,759 --> 00:05:46,592
- [Joel] Oh, let's go, uh, that way.

183
00:05:46,592 --> 00:05:47,425
- [Tom] No, wait!
- [Joel] Hey!

184
00:05:47,425 --> 00:05:48,344
- [Tom] We're supposed to go that

185
00:05:48,344 --> 00:05:49,177
way.

186
00:05:49,177 --> 00:05:50,094
What gives?

187
00:05:51,213 --> 00:05:52,368
Hm.

188
00:05:52,368 --> 00:05:53,201
- [Joel] Hey,

189
00:05:53,201 --> 00:05:54,699
hi, everybody.

190
00:05:54,699 --> 00:05:55,532
(solemn march music)

191
00:05:55,532 --> 00:05:57,266
Oh, I see.
(robots grumble)

192
00:05:57,266 --> 00:05:59,933
- [Tom] Yeah, it's one of those.

193
00:06:01,738 --> 00:06:04,863
♫ Look for the Union radar

194
00:06:04,863 --> 00:06:07,475
♫ When you are dying and the ♫

195
00:06:07,475 --> 00:06:09,930
- [Crow] Look, Lyndon LaRouche's brother!

196
00:06:09,930 --> 00:06:11,546
They just bought drugs
from the Queen of England!

197
00:06:11,546 --> 00:06:12,779
- [Joel] Shoes by Botany 500,

198
00:06:12,779 --> 00:06:13,613
body by Fischer.

199
00:06:13,613 --> 00:06:15,190
- [Crow] He looks like Count Chocula.

200
00:06:15,190 --> 00:06:16,903
- [Tom] Shouldn't they
have their high beams on?

201
00:06:16,903 --> 00:06:18,986
- [Joel] It must be cold.

202
00:06:20,462 --> 00:06:21,295
- [Tom] Okay, everybody on set

203
00:06:21,295 --> 00:06:22,698
