605
00:18:09,001 --> 00:18:10,864
- Betty, we've been over all that before.

606
00:18:10,864 --> 00:18:13,856
I'm studying medicine not
because Dad was a doctor,

607
00:18:13,856 --> 00:18:14,689
but because--
- [Tom] I'm old!

608
00:18:14,689 --> 00:18:16,051
(Lewis mumbles)
I've got a practice!

609
00:18:16,051 --> 00:18:18,189
I've been a respected doctor for 20 years!

610
00:18:18,189 --> 00:18:20,069
- I'm not afraid of any of it!

611
00:18:20,069 --> 00:18:21,724
I'm not afraid of the blood or the corpses

612
00:18:21,724 --> 00:18:23,298
or the operations!

613
00:18:23,298 --> 00:18:24,680
- [Joel] That's why I love you!

614
00:18:24,680 --> 00:18:25,513
- That's very important for a doctor

615
00:18:25,513 --> 00:18:27,397
to do his duties well!

616
00:18:27,397 --> 00:18:28,321
I'm sorry, Betty,

617
00:18:28,321 --> 00:18:30,642
if you're not interested in all that.

618
00:18:30,642 --> 00:18:32,685
- It's my fault, darling.

619
00:18:32,685 --> 00:18:35,024
I'll never bring up the subject again!

620
00:18:35,024 --> 00:18:37,524
- [Crow] I'm that codependent!

621
00:18:38,873 --> 00:18:42,019
(robots slurping)

622
00:18:42,019 --> 00:18:44,248
(horror music)
- [Joel] Hi, I'm Satan!

623
00:18:44,248 --> 00:18:46,132
This is what happens when
you do the hanky panky

624
00:18:46,132 --> 00:18:47,614
before you're married!

625
00:18:47,614 --> 00:18:48,754
Let's watch the fun!

626
00:18:48,754 --> 00:18:50,407
Really!

627
00:18:50,407 --> 00:18:54,825
(Crow slurps)
- [Tom] Oh Captain Spalding!

628
00:18:54,825 --> 00:18:55,658
- [Joel] Cooking.

629
00:18:55,658 --> 00:18:56,491
Lucky for me,

630
00:18:56,491 --> 00:18:58,433
