1099
00:32:20,211 --> 00:32:21,772
315 Broadway.
(gunshots blasting)

1100
00:32:21,772 --> 00:32:23,833
- [Joel] Now I know
that's a lot of numbers

1101
00:32:23,833 --> 00:32:24,964
