- [Rayburn] Thank you!

1102
00:32:24,964 --> 00:32:27,199
- Right!
(telephone thuds)

1103
00:32:27,199 --> 00:32:28,189
- [Joel] Hey.
- This is it fellas!

1104
00:32:28,189 --> 00:32:29,802
