1112
00:32:38,058 --> 00:32:39,283
You, put on that band uniform!

1113
00:32:39,283 --> 00:32:40,639
You, grab those things!
- [Tom] And you!

1114
00:32:40,639 --> 00:32:41,834
- [Tom] And you!

1115
00:32:41,834 --> 00:32:42,667
And you!

1116
00:32:42,667 --> 00:32:43,500
You know what to do!

1117
00:32:43,500 --> 00:32:44,380
Hey,

1118
00:32:44,380 --> 00:32:45,558
Morrison Hall.

1119
00:32:45,558 --> 00:32:46,563
Break on through, dudes.

1120
00:32:46,563 --> 00:32:47,794
- [Joel] Mm, there's the door

1121
00:32:47,794 --> 00:32:48,810
