(Howard mumbles)

1127
00:32:55,004 --> 00:32:56,015
- And Jerry,

1128
00:32:56,015 --> 00:32:57,125
you can take six, can't you?

1129
00:32:57,125 --> 00:32:59,135
- [Joel] I always do!
- Yeah I can take six with me!

1130
00:32:59,135 --> 00:33:00,109
- Good!

1131
00:33:00,109 --> 00:33:01,153
We'll see ya there.

1132
00:33:01,153 --> 00:33:02,153
And remember,

1133
00:33:02,153 --> 00:33:03,326
315 Broadway!

1134
00:33:03,326 --> 00:33:05,978
Come on, let's go!
(robot cheers)

1135
00:33:05,978 --> 00:33:07,783
♫ Oh, we're going to see the dead guy

1136
00:33:07,783 --> 00:33:09,541
♫ We're going to see the dead guy

1137
00:33:09,541 --> 00:33:11,167
♫ Hoo ♫

1138
00:33:11,167 --> 00:33:12,950
- [Crow] So all 55 students
crammed like clowns,

1139
00:33:12,950 --> 00:33:14,596
