1141
00:33:15,652 --> 00:33:18,338
with not one head rising above the seat!

1142
00:33:18,338 --> 00:33:20,432
And they kept their blinker on

1143
00:33:20,432 --> 00:33:22,078
(car rumbles)
the whole way.

1144
00:33:22,078 --> 00:33:23,509
- [Tom] Phew!

1145
00:33:23,509 --> 00:33:26,738
