1152
00:33:55,240 --> 00:33:56,361
- [Student] Run upstairs, upstairs!

1153
00:33:56,361 --> 00:33:57,344
- [Crow] Hurry!

1154
00:33:57,344 --> 00:34:00,314
- [Joel] It's like the
dead guy can't wait.

1155
00:34:00,314 --> 00:34:01,207
