your future medical career!

1160
00:34:11,397 --> 00:34:13,227
- [All] Uh-huh, yeah, go on.

1161
00:34:13,227 --> 00:34:14,243
Yeah, sure.

1162
00:34:14,243 --> 00:34:15,743
- Some of us may succeed,

1163
00:34:15,743 --> 00:34:18,372
and some of us may falter.

1164
00:34:18,372 --> 00:34:19,996
- [Tom] But words will never hurt us!

1165
00:34:19,996 --> 00:34:21,639
- [Rayburn] However strong we may feel--

1166
00:34:21,639 --> 00:34:23,480
- [Joel] Our bones are very brittle!

1167
00:34:23,480 --> 00:34:25,370
- [Rayburn] Some of us cannot overcome

1168
00:34:25,370 --> 00:34:27,007
