1174
00:34:37,280 --> 00:34:38,702
- [Joel] To blow chow!

1175
00:34:38,702 --> 00:34:40,836
- [Crow] To chuck the chow on
the white porcelain throne!

1176
00:34:40,836 --> 00:34:42,227
- [Tom] To summon the earl.

1177
00:34:42,227 --> 00:34:43,774
- Accustom ourselves

1178
00:34:43,774 --> 00:34:47,198
to the callousness
- [Crow] Of the script.

1179
00:34:47,198 --> 00:34:50,561
