(Tom chuckles)

1180
00:34:50,561 --> 00:34:52,038
Mister Moffitt!

1181
00:34:52,038 --> 00:34:53,306
- [Tom] Show the boys your toffit!

1182
00:34:53,306 --> 00:34:55,210
- [Rayburn] Will you roll
in Mister John Doe, please?

1183
00:34:55,210 --> 00:34:56,260
- [Joel] Oh, with pleasure, sir.

1184
00:34:56,260 --> 00:34:58,053
I'd be happy to do it!

1185
00:34:58,053 --> 00:34:59,599
- [Tom] Kiss up.

1186
00:34:59,599 --> 00:35:01,870
- [Crow] I'm queasy!

1187
00:35:01,870 --> 00:35:03,306
- [Tom] I'm Nauseous!

1188
00:35:03,306 --> 00:35:04,487
- [Joel] I'm Sickin'!

1189
00:35:04,487 --> 00:35:06,570
- [Crow] I'm hungry, too!

1190
00:35:10,771 --> 00:35:14,104
- [Tom] Bump-bump, bump-bump, bump-bump.

1191
00:35:15,632 --> 00:35:18,049
Oh, I forgot he's dead.

1192
00:35:18,049 --> 00:35:18,882
Hm.

1193
00:35:21,456 --> 00:35:23,436
- [Joel] Okay, okay, let's go!

1194
00:35:23,436 --> 00:35:24,655
Let's go!

1195
00:35:24,655 --> 00:35:26,457
- [Tom] It all looks so good!

1196
00:35:26,457 --> 00:35:27,773
- [Joel] Hm!
(dramatic music)

1197
00:35:27,773 --> 00:35:29,767
(robots gasp)

1198
00:35:29,767 --> 00:35:30,910
- Mister John Doe

1199
00:35:30,910 --> 00:35:34,117
