- [Crow] Dibs, dibs!

1201
00:35:35,194 --> 00:35:36,982
A gold ring.

1202
00:35:36,982 --> 00:35:39,144
- [Joel] Hey, check out that guy!

1203
00:35:39,144 --> 00:35:40,780
He's got a really cute wrist!

1204
00:35:40,780 --> 00:35:43,168
- [Tom] Ah, not as cute as his down there!

1205
00:35:43,168 --> 00:35:47,442
- [Crow] I know they're
lookin' at my wrist.

1206
00:35:47,442 --> 00:35:48,819
- We shall begin
- [Tom] The begane!

1207
00:35:48,819 --> 00:35:50,902
with a pectoral incision!

1208
00:35:52,968 --> 00:35:57,349
- [Tom] Bum, bum, bum!
(ominous music)

1209
00:35:57,349 --> 00:35:58,182
Bum, bum!

1210
00:35:59,572 --> 00:36:01,037
- [Joel] Ooh, I'm so ashamed!

1211
00:36:01,037 --> 00:36:02,495
- [Tom] I've been living a lie!

1212
00:36:02,495 --> 00:36:04,071
- [Crow] Oh, I want a
potato sandwich, too!

1213
00:36:04,071 --> 00:36:05,570
- [Joel] Teacher's pet!

1214
00:36:05,570 --> 00:36:07,498
Now, earlier today,

1215
00:36:07,498 --> 00:36:10,165
I baked a corpse at 425 degrees.

1216
00:36:12,202 --> 00:36:14,035
- [Tom] Dum, dum, dum.

1217
00:36:16,296 --> 00:36:20,969
- [Rayburn] Then we follow
with an abdominal incision!

1218
00:36:20,969 --> 00:36:22,903
- [Tom] And a light lemon-chiffon sauce!

1219
00:36:22,903 --> 00:36:24,070
With shallots.

1220
00:36:27,217 --> 00:36:29,154
(Joel moans)

1221
00:36:29,154 --> 00:36:30,903
- We have now exposed

1222
00:36:30,903 --> 00:36:33,070
the gastrovascular cavity.

1223
00:36:34,031 --> 00:36:36,504
- [Crow] Which should be
stuffed with a sage dressing.

1224
00:36:36,504 --> 00:36:38,860
- We have cut through the epidermis.

1225
00:36:38,860 --> 00:36:41,277
And you see this yellow mass.

1226
00:36:42,965 --> 00:36:44,708
That's the fatty tissue.

1227
00:36:44,708 --> 00:36:46,597
- [Tom] Which should be
whipped into stiff peaks!

1228
00:36:46,597 --> 00:36:48,847
- [Joel] Oh, the fatty, oh!

1229
00:36:52,034 --> 00:36:52,867
Hm.

1230
00:36:52,867 --> 00:36:55,362
- [Rayburn] We then proceed to the right!

1231
00:36:55,362 --> 00:36:57,665
And locate the dew-wattle.

1232
00:36:57,665 --> 00:37:00,671
- [Joel] Oh, the da-wah, oh!

1233
00:37:00,671 --> 00:37:02,646
- Now, gentlemen,

1234
00:37:02,646 --> 00:37:04,273
please pay close attention!

1235
00:37:04,273 --> 00:37:05,835
- [Crow] The show is down here, gentlemen!

1236
00:37:05,835 --> 00:37:06,874
- [Rayburn] I'm about to show you.

1237
00:37:06,874 --> 00:37:08,135
- [Joel] Uh, say, huh, doctor guy?

1238
00:37:08,135 --> 00:37:10,382
Uh, could we have some
of those tools up here?

1239
00:37:10,382 --> 00:37:11,760
We got another one up here!
- [Rayburn] By the muscles.

1240
00:37:11,760 --> 00:37:15,787
- [Rayburn] Now this is most
important in the human body.

1241
00:37:15,787 --> 00:37:17,401
- [Joel] My boss.

1242
00:37:17,401 --> 00:37:19,017
He always goes on like this!

1243
00:37:19,017 --> 00:37:20,232
Now, on with the show!

1244
00:37:20,232 --> 00:37:22,243
- [Tom] Uh, mic up, please?

1245
00:37:22,243 --> 00:37:23,262
Microphone!

1246
00:37:23,262 --> 00:37:24,519
- [Joel] Audio!

1247
00:37:24,519 --> 00:37:26,367
- [Crow] You come in here with
a corpse filled with mush,

1248
00:37:26,367 --> 00:37:29,079
