1249
00:37:29,079 --> 00:37:31,700
- [Joel] Remind me to never
eat those Spaghetti-Os.

1250
00:37:31,700 --> 00:37:33,387
- [Crow] One day, that'll be me.

1251
00:37:33,387 --> 00:37:35,397
- [Joel] I just said remind me not to eat

1252
00:37:35,397 --> 00:37:36,674
