1257
00:37:42,820 --> 00:37:43,653
I gotta eat soon.

1258
00:37:43,653 --> 00:37:45,062
I got a Grateful Dead concert to go to.

1259
00:37:45,062 --> 00:37:46,405
Hey, wait a minute!

1260
00:37:46,405 --> 00:37:49,196
(Rayburn mumbles under soft audio)

1261
00:37:49,196 --> 00:37:50,029
- [Crow] You do the hokey-pokey,

1262
00:37:50,029 --> 00:37:50,862
turn yourself around.

1263
00:37:50,862 --> 00:37:51,695
That's really what it's all about!

1264
00:37:51,695 --> 00:37:52,528
- It's really very simple!

1265
00:37:52,528 --> 00:37:56,249
Now that we've, uh, made
the pectoral incision,

1266
00:37:56,249 --> 00:37:57,676
I want you to notice

1267
00:37:57,676 --> 00:37:59,713
